/Title (The duoplasmatron ion sources at Uppsala Universities Tandem laboratory deliver around 70% of the scheduled beam time, making their reliable operation critical for scientific output. However, the chaotic nature of plasma combined with the high parameter-space used to operate lead to long-term instabilities, day-to-day shifts in optimal settings and poor reproducibility. Despite these limitations duplasmatron sources remain widely used at small and medium-scale accelerator laboratories due to lack of practical alternatives [1].)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 642 0 R
/Next 1847 0 R
>>
