/Title (The high-parameter space and chaotic dynamics of ion sources has made machine learning alternatives toward automation increasingly researched. This seed project took the first steps  toward AI-assisted operation of Tandems duoplasmatron ion source by implementing a structured database for relevant control parameters and readout values and investigated beam stablity and intensity correlation to the operator parameters using classification and regression models.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 642 0 R
/Prev 1262 0 R
/Next 1263 0 R
>>
