1848 0 obj
<<
/Title (Ion sources: Heated filament emits electrons \(thermionic emission\), which ignite an arc discharge in helium gas and create a plasma. A magnet around the source compresses the plasma, and ions are extracted by a fixed extraction voltage and a 40 kV pre-acceleration. This project looks at the second source \(S2\) intended for producing Helium isotopes.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1265 0 R
/Next 1864 0 R
>>
endobj
